WEBVTT

00:00:05.589 --> 00:00:09.175
This has been a test of the
Emergency Hypnotoad System.

00:00:09.259 --> 00:00:11.177
Had this been
an actual hypnosis,

00:00:11.261 --> 00:00:14.639
you would go limp and watch
whatever crap comes on next.

00:00:14.723 --> 00:00:17.308
Coming up next, Futurama!

00:00:25.609 --> 00:00:28.027
Professor, my Fry-fro
is all frizzy.

00:00:28.112 --> 00:00:29.278
Okay.

00:00:29.405 --> 00:00:30.530
Well, that's all.

00:00:30.614 --> 00:00:33.116
Also, I'm covered
with severe burns.

00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:34.742
So? What of it?

00:00:34.827 --> 00:00:37.453
Well, why is
those things?

00:00:37.663 --> 00:00:40.373
You mean,
you don't remember?

00:00:40.457 --> 00:00:43.376
Nope. Nothing. It's like
when I passed out in college,

00:00:43.460 --> 00:00:46.421
except no one drew Magic
Marker penises on my forehead.

00:00:46.505 --> 00:00:48.881
Well, I suppose
it's for the best,

00:00:48.966 --> 00:00:52.218
considering the unbearable
horrors you've endured.

00:00:52.302 --> 00:00:54.262
Let's never speak
of it again.

00:00:54.638 --> 00:00:56.723
It all began
a few days ago.

00:00:57.141 --> 00:01:01.561
We were interstellar fugitives
on the run from the law.

00:01:01.645 --> 00:01:06.065
Fire all weapons and open a hailing
frequency for my victory yodel.

00:01:17.995 --> 00:01:21.289
And so, as you and Leela kissed goodbye

00:01:21.373 --> 00:01:23.833
in a tender display
of tonguesmanship,

00:01:24.084 --> 00:01:29.505
we plunged into a massive
wormhole, never to be seen again.

00:01:32.885 --> 00:01:35.178
Yeah, we're back.

00:01:36.138 --> 00:01:39.932
Sweet coincidence of
Port-au-Prince, we're back at Earth!

00:01:40.017 --> 00:01:41.142
Of course!

00:01:41.226 --> 00:01:45.605
That was the Panama wormhole!
Earth's central channel for shipping.

00:01:47.024 --> 00:01:48.232
How humorous.

00:01:48.417 --> 00:01:51.794
Yes, it's sort of
a Comedy Central channel.

00:01:51.879 --> 00:01:53.296
And we're on it now!

00:01:54.464 --> 00:01:55.548
I get it!

00:02:06.351 --> 00:02:08.352
We've lost power
to the forward Game Boy.

00:02:08.437 --> 00:02:09.937
Mario not responding!

00:02:10.063 --> 00:02:11.731
Brace for emergency landing!

00:02:11.815 --> 00:02:14.609
Roger that.
Activate safety spheres!

00:02:20.824 --> 00:02:23.326
Also, mine has
air conditioning.

00:02:40.802 --> 00:02:43.387
Yet, thanks to my
trusty safety sphere,

00:02:43.472 --> 00:02:46.432
I sublibed with only
tribial brain dablage.

00:02:46.600 --> 00:02:47.600
And the others?

00:02:47.684 --> 00:02:50.436
Right here,
behind this horror-cloth.

00:02:50.520 --> 00:02:51.520
Are they dead?

00:02:51.647 --> 00:02:53.731
No, no, no, no.
Much worse.

00:03:31.979 --> 00:03:35.815
Move over, God!
Prepare for rebirth!

00:03:38.902 --> 00:03:40.403
Wrong switch.

00:03:49.663 --> 00:03:54.625
Come on, stem cells, work your
astounding scientific nonsense.

00:03:54.751 --> 00:03:56.127
Fetal stem cells?

00:03:56.211 --> 00:03:57.712
Aren't those controversial?

00:03:57.796 --> 00:04:01.340
In your time, yes,
but nowadays, shut up!

00:04:01.425 --> 00:04:03.843
Besides, these are
adult stem cells

00:04:03.927 --> 00:04:06.220
harvested from
perfectly healthy adults

00:04:06.304 --> 00:04:08.931
whom I killed for
their stem cells.

00:04:19.693 --> 00:04:21.027
Hermes Conrad!

00:04:24.281 --> 00:04:27.116
Man! I'm dripping
with placenta.

00:04:27.200 --> 00:04:28.951
Good thing it's
Casual Friday.

00:04:32.456 --> 00:04:33.581
Amy Wong!

00:04:33.707 --> 00:04:36.125
Ooh! Baby soft.

00:04:36.710 --> 00:04:38.127
Indeed.

00:04:39.880 --> 00:04:41.213
Dr. Zoidberg!

00:04:41.298 --> 00:04:45.718
Hermes, my friend. Let me
cut off your umbilical cord.

00:04:47.345 --> 00:04:48.429
Oops.

00:04:49.306 --> 00:04:50.598
And the rest!

00:04:50.682 --> 00:04:52.767
Hooray!
We're back in business.

00:04:52.851 --> 00:04:55.186
Over my dead body.

00:04:57.481 --> 00:04:59.440
Uh, never mind.

00:05:02.527 --> 00:05:05.237
Bender, are the
stem cells working? Ow!

00:05:08.033 --> 00:05:09.909
I'm dying.

00:05:10.368 --> 00:05:12.912
I need mouth-to-ass
resuscitation.

00:05:12.996 --> 00:05:14.622
I'm on it!

00:05:16.583 --> 00:05:18.084
It's not working!

00:05:19.503 --> 00:05:22.379
I die happy knowing
you fell for that.

00:05:23.673 --> 00:05:27.051
His power supply is shut.
He's flatlining!

00:05:29.763 --> 00:05:32.181
Only one thing
can keep him alive.

00:05:33.475 --> 00:05:34.975
Possibly this thing.

00:05:41.358 --> 00:05:44.276
Whoo! I've never
felt so energetic!

00:05:45.904 --> 00:05:48.948
That's because the doomsday
device I shoved all up in you

00:05:49.032 --> 00:05:50.825
puts out 50 gigawatts.

00:05:50.909 --> 00:05:52.660
That's 10 times
your recommended...

00:05:52.744 --> 00:05:55.162
Who are you,
my warranty?

00:05:55.831 --> 00:05:57.540
That was a good...

00:06:01.211 --> 00:06:02.336
Huh?

00:06:02.420 --> 00:06:04.713
For God sakes,
Bender, keep dancing!

00:06:05.090 --> 00:06:06.715
Keep whooping it up!

00:06:08.718 --> 00:06:12.555
You must burn off the doomsday
energy as fast as it's produced,

00:06:12.639 --> 00:06:14.849
or it will build
to critical levels!

00:06:14.975 --> 00:06:16.809
You don't mean...

00:06:17.018 --> 00:06:18.477
Oh, but I do.

00:06:18.562 --> 00:06:21.105
If you stop partying
for a single second,

00:06:21.231 --> 00:06:23.816
you'll explode and
kill everyone here

00:06:23.900 --> 00:06:28.070
in a fireball of melted gears
and splattered bowels!

00:06:29.906 --> 00:06:32.408
Sounds like a party, baby!
Ooh, yeah!

00:06:34.035 --> 00:06:35.953
Hey, speaking of
splattered bowels,

00:06:36.037 --> 00:06:38.372
can I cook you a romantic dinner tonight, Leela?

00:06:39.082 --> 00:06:40.416
Where's Leela?

00:06:44.171 --> 00:06:45.462
Is she okay?

00:06:45.547 --> 00:06:47.506
Why hasn't she acknowledged
my dinner offer?

00:06:47.591 --> 00:06:48.549
Something's wrong!

00:06:48.633 --> 00:06:51.260
She's not responding
to my poking stick.

00:06:52.262 --> 00:06:53.470
Poke harder, damn it!

00:06:53.638 --> 00:06:56.056
I'm poking as hard
as I can!

00:06:56.141 --> 00:07:02.396
I'm sorry, Fry, but I'm afraid
Leela is in an irreversible coma.

00:07:06.234 --> 00:07:10.696
Coma, coma, coma, coma,
coma chameleon

00:07:19.372 --> 00:07:24.001
My soul mate is gone.
Why should I go on living?

00:07:24.085 --> 00:07:28.047
Because the pain slowly
fades, but the love is forever.

00:07:28.465 --> 00:07:29.590
Yow!

00:07:29.883 --> 00:07:32.718
But what if I forget
the sweet sound of her voice,

00:07:32.802 --> 00:07:35.471
or the moist touch of
her eyeball on my lips?

00:07:36.223 --> 00:07:39.642
Are you still hung up on
what's-her-name? Move on already!

00:07:40.644 --> 00:07:41.644
Maybe you're right.

00:07:41.770 --> 00:07:43.312
Maybe I'm always right.

00:07:55.992 --> 00:07:58.035
"Build-a-Bot Workshop".

00:07:58.328 --> 00:08:00.371
It's time to start
living again.

00:08:08.129 --> 00:08:10.839
At least it's something
to distract me from Leela.

00:08:14.928 --> 00:08:16.136
Nah.

00:08:18.223 --> 00:08:19.890
Now, that I like
for some reason.

00:08:25.647 --> 00:08:28.649
I like jelly beans.
Do you?

00:08:28.733 --> 00:08:30.067
I sure do, honey.

00:08:30.860 --> 00:08:34.405
Come now, Fry, you can't
live out this sick fantasy.

00:08:34.489 --> 00:08:35.948
Not without our help.

00:08:37.284 --> 00:08:40.661
These security tapes record
everything at Planet Express,

00:08:40.745 --> 00:08:43.289
including the ship,
shower and urinals.

00:08:43.373 --> 00:08:46.834
And yet, it still hasn't stopped
the elusive bathroom burglar.

00:08:46.918 --> 00:08:49.753
Maybe he's just trying
to feed his family.

00:08:51.298 --> 00:08:53.674
Computer,
analyze tapes and extract

00:08:53.758 --> 00:08:56.468
personality profile
of one Turanga Leela.

00:08:56.553 --> 00:09:00.097
Analyzing. Analyzing. Checking my eBay bid.

00:09:00.181 --> 00:09:03.017
Damn it! Analysis complete.

00:09:05.228 --> 00:09:07.771
Hey, I was nuzzling that.

00:09:07.856 --> 00:09:11.233
Attributes transferred.
Shoe size 12. Et cetera.

00:09:13.403 --> 00:09:15.154
Brace for
emergency landing!

00:09:15.739 --> 00:09:17.656
What?
We survived the crash?

00:09:17.741 --> 00:09:19.241
Oh, Fry!

00:09:20.660 --> 00:09:23.579
Party people in
the house say...

00:09:23.997 --> 00:09:25.205
This is wonderful.

00:09:25.290 --> 00:09:28.125
The last thing I remember,
I was dying in an explosion.

00:09:28.209 --> 00:09:31.628
Yet, here I am in the flesh,
more alive than ever.

00:09:31.838 --> 00:09:34.048
Alive?

00:09:34.132 --> 00:09:35.299
You better
tell her, Fry.

00:09:35.383 --> 00:09:36.425
Tell me what?

00:09:36.676 --> 00:09:39.928
Anyway, my work is done.
I'm gonna hit the showers.

00:09:44.017 --> 00:09:46.685
Nibbler.
Come, give Mama a hug.

00:09:48.063 --> 00:09:50.773
What the...
Bad Nibbler! Bad Nibbler!

00:09:52.275 --> 00:09:54.068
What're you doing,
pooper doodle?

00:09:54.152 --> 00:09:55.778
It's me, Leela!

00:10:13.797 --> 00:10:15.381
Am I really just a robot?

00:10:15.715 --> 00:10:17.758
I mean,
I have Leela's memories.

00:10:17.842 --> 00:10:20.803
Her opinion of gazelles,
majestic.

00:10:20.887 --> 00:10:24.056
Her emotions,
confused and hurt.

00:10:24.182 --> 00:10:26.850
I swear, I didn't know
this would happen.

00:10:27.143 --> 00:10:30.729
The only thing I truly know
is I love you.

00:10:31.606 --> 00:10:33.399
I mean, her.
Wait, help me out here.

00:10:46.162 --> 00:10:48.205
Do the Bender!
Do the Bender!

00:10:48.289 --> 00:10:49.665
No, thank you.

00:10:49.749 --> 00:10:50.916
I said, do it!

00:10:51.000 --> 00:10:54.253
The truth is, Fry, I still have feelings for you.

00:10:54.337 --> 00:10:56.296
But are they really
my feelings?

00:10:56.381 --> 00:10:58.090
Am I just an automaton,

00:10:58.174 --> 00:11:00.134
or can a machine of
sufficient complexity

00:11:00.218 --> 00:11:02.511
legitimately
achieve consciousness?

00:11:02.720 --> 00:11:03.762
I agree.

00:11:03.888 --> 00:11:07.975
I need some time to figure
this out. Until then, friends?

00:11:08.476 --> 00:11:09.518
Okay.

00:11:09.602 --> 00:11:11.520
Listen up, disco dummies!

00:11:11.604 --> 00:11:15.399
You just flunked out of Bender's
College of Party Knowledge.

00:11:18.862 --> 00:11:19.862
Yeah, baby!

00:11:23.867 --> 00:11:26.577
Do the back dance,
do the back dance.

00:11:30.206 --> 00:11:31.748
Good news,
everyone.

00:11:31.916 --> 00:11:35.711
I'm going to make one final
attempt to awaken Leela.

00:11:37.380 --> 00:11:39.923
After all,
there's always hope.

00:11:40.049 --> 00:11:42.676
Really? No, don't get your hopes up.

00:11:42.760 --> 00:11:46.263
Frankly, she's just a brainless
mound of scabs and puss.

00:11:46.431 --> 00:11:49.308
I didn't
need to hear that.

00:11:49.392 --> 00:11:51.685
No, and you don't
need to see this.

00:11:53.897 --> 00:11:58.775
Wake up! Wake up!
Wake up! Wake up!

00:12:00.028 --> 00:12:02.571
Wake up! Wake up!

00:12:02.655 --> 00:12:05.282
Wake up! Wake up!

00:12:06.242 --> 00:12:07.743
Well, that's it.

00:12:07.827 --> 00:12:10.746
I'm afraid traditional
medicine has failed.

00:12:11.581 --> 00:12:13.790
No!
I refuse to give up!

00:12:14.250 --> 00:12:17.753
Wake up, Leela!
I love you!

00:12:17.837 --> 00:12:20.506
Fry, stop.
She's gone.

00:12:20.840 --> 00:12:23.133
Dr. Zoidberg,
can you note the time

00:12:23.218 --> 00:12:25.427
and declare the patient
legally dead?

00:12:25.553 --> 00:12:28.222
Can I?
That's my specialty!

00:12:42.278 --> 00:12:46.448
As you all know, Leela's living will
states that in the event of coma,

00:12:46.616 --> 00:12:49.368
her body is to be fed
to the wild cyclophage,

00:12:49.452 --> 00:12:52.371
a highly endangered creature
that eats only Cyclopses.

00:12:52.455 --> 00:12:54.873
Yup, that's what
her donor card says.

00:12:58.044 --> 00:13:00.796
Goodbye, my love.

00:13:05.927 --> 00:13:07.427
The beast approacheth!

00:13:13.309 --> 00:13:15.561
To the beat, y'all
To the beat, y'all

00:13:15.645 --> 00:13:17.896
I'm dancing a jig
with my feet, y'all

00:13:17.981 --> 00:13:21.608
Bender, cut it out. People
are trying to have emotions.

00:13:21.693 --> 00:13:24.528
You think I want to party?
I'm sick of partying.

00:13:25.029 --> 00:13:26.738
Woo-hoo!
More partying!

00:13:28.283 --> 00:13:29.700
Quiet, Bender.
Cut it out.

00:13:34.497 --> 00:13:37.374
Bender!
Shut the hell up!

00:13:44.173 --> 00:13:46.091
Bender!
Stop shutting the hell up!

00:13:46.342 --> 00:13:49.636
Right. Leela's back,
as if I care.

00:13:49.804 --> 00:13:50.846
Whoo!

00:13:50.972 --> 00:13:53.056
All right, Leela!

00:13:54.392 --> 00:13:57.853
Thanks. It's so nice
to wake up and see...

00:14:01.316 --> 00:14:02.899
Leela!
Leela?

00:14:02.984 --> 00:14:04.610
Leela?
Leela.

00:14:04.777 --> 00:14:06.028
How is this possible?

00:14:06.112 --> 00:14:08.655
And can you believe she wore
a tank top to my funeral?

00:14:08.740 --> 00:14:10.282
Shut up! We got to get out of here!

00:14:16.497 --> 00:14:18.957
No, you shut up,
we got to get out of here.

00:14:31.387 --> 00:14:32.679
Yeah, baby.
Come on!

00:14:34.599 --> 00:14:36.266
All aboard the party ship!

00:14:41.314 --> 00:14:43.982
There's no room for two
captains' butts in this chair.

00:14:44.067 --> 00:14:46.151
There would be if you'd
taken a spin class

00:14:46.235 --> 00:14:48.278
instead of lounging around
in a coma!

00:15:00.333 --> 00:15:01.416
This is crazy.

00:15:01.542 --> 00:15:05.003
It's like I'm looking at an
exact robot duplicate of myself.

00:15:05.088 --> 00:15:07.047
That is what
you're looking at.

00:15:07.131 --> 00:15:08.131
Oh.

00:15:08.257 --> 00:15:09.633
How could you
do this, Fry?

00:15:09.759 --> 00:15:12.010
Coma... Sad...

00:15:12.095 --> 00:15:14.763
I have to go.
This is just too freaky!

00:15:15.807 --> 00:15:18.850
Please don't get upset,
Leela. She's nothing like you.

00:15:18.935 --> 00:15:21.603
I have to go.
This is just too freaky.

00:15:27.860 --> 00:15:29.861
I need cheering up,
Bender.

00:15:29.946 --> 00:15:32.614
I don't know, do you want
to go out and party tonight?

00:15:32.699 --> 00:15:34.032
I hate partying.

00:15:34.117 --> 00:15:37.285
If only I didn't have so
much crunk in my badonkadonk.

00:15:37.412 --> 00:15:39.037
Yeah. Come on, baby.

00:15:39.122 --> 00:15:41.581
Why does everything
I date run away?

00:15:41.874 --> 00:15:45.085
I love Leela,
always and forever,

00:15:45.169 --> 00:15:47.212
and if I loved
robot Leela, too,

00:15:47.296 --> 00:15:51.133
well, that's only 'cause she
had so much of real Leela in her.

00:15:51.467 --> 00:15:56.304
I thought she loved me, too, but,
obviously, I was wrong as usual.

00:15:56.597 --> 00:15:58.807
Wrong again.
You were right.

00:15:58.933 --> 00:16:01.393
Leela? Leela-Leela?

00:16:01.477 --> 00:16:02.728
Leela-Leela.

00:16:03.062 --> 00:16:04.563
I've been thinking, Fry.

00:16:04.647 --> 00:16:07.733
If I lost you, I don't think
I could stand it, either.

00:16:07.817 --> 00:16:10.694
I'd probably build
a copy of you, too.

00:16:11.487 --> 00:16:14.823
As long as robo-Leela's not a
jealous type like me, things will...

00:16:14.907 --> 00:16:17.075
I'll kill you,
you slut-clops!

00:16:18.411 --> 00:16:19.536
He's mine!

00:16:19.620 --> 00:16:21.079
Back off, missy!

00:16:28.504 --> 00:16:29.963
Somebody do something!

00:16:30.047 --> 00:16:31.465
Here, take this!

00:16:31.674 --> 00:16:33.425
A gun?
Do I really need to...

00:16:33.509 --> 00:16:35.343
Shoot her!
She's the robot!

00:16:35.428 --> 00:16:38.138
No! Shoot her!
She's the human!

00:16:38.222 --> 00:16:41.266
But how do I know who's the
human and who's the robot?

00:16:41.350 --> 00:16:42.434
We just told you!

00:16:42.518 --> 00:16:43.685
Yeah, you idiot!

00:16:43.853 --> 00:16:48.398
Okay. Fine. If you're going to be
like that, I'm not shooting anyone.

00:16:50.359 --> 00:16:53.528
Right between the lungs.
Man, that was close.

00:17:00.620 --> 00:17:01.995
I'm a robot, too!

00:17:02.121 --> 00:17:05.791
Aha! That explains this
growth on your drive shaft!

00:17:05.875 --> 00:17:07.459
But how is this possible?

00:17:07.543 --> 00:17:10.128
Who knows? Oh, I do.

00:17:10.213 --> 00:17:14.466
Allow me to explain what really
happened the day the ship crashed.

00:17:22.058 --> 00:17:23.475
I'll protect you, Leela.

00:17:23.559 --> 00:17:27.103
My love is stronger than the
vast majority of explosions.

00:17:29.649 --> 00:17:34.402
Fry did, in fact, save Leela,
though at a terrible cost to himself.

00:17:34.737 --> 00:17:36.613
I tossed him
into the stem cells,

00:17:36.739 --> 00:17:40.992
but he just bubbled away
like phlegm on a hot sidewalk.

00:17:41.285 --> 00:17:43.119
Leela was so distraught,

00:17:43.246 --> 00:17:46.248
she went all Blade Runner
and built a duplicate.

00:17:46.582 --> 00:17:49.334
Then, uploaded
Fry's personality

00:17:49.418 --> 00:17:51.837
from the urinal
surveillance tapes.

00:17:51.921 --> 00:17:53.338
I sure love Leela.

00:17:55.925 --> 00:17:59.719
Alas, in recreating Fry's adorable jelly-belly,

00:17:59.804 --> 00:18:02.806
she had overstuffed him
with copper wadding.

00:18:04.600 --> 00:18:08.144
The inevitable static
discharge electrocuted Leela,

00:18:08.229 --> 00:18:11.398
and destroyed both of their short-term memories.

00:18:11.774 --> 00:18:15.193
So that's why I'm so amazed
by these things I already knew.

00:18:15.278 --> 00:18:16.403
What could I do?

00:18:16.487 --> 00:18:18.655
I hung up Leela with
the other bone bags

00:18:18.739 --> 00:18:22.325
and went to procure the final
ingredient for my stem cell brew.

00:18:27.331 --> 00:18:29.749
Professor, my Fry-fro
is all frizzy.

00:18:29.834 --> 00:18:31.001
My God!

00:18:31.085 --> 00:18:34.462
I can't believe I'll never
see that particular Fry again.

00:18:38.718 --> 00:18:39.968
Hey, where's my shoes?

00:18:41.304 --> 00:18:42.304
Fry?

00:18:42.388 --> 00:18:44.973
I'm sorry. I didn't realize I was already here.

00:18:45.349 --> 00:18:47.392
Wait, what's with
all the Leelas?

00:18:47.476 --> 00:18:48.768
Trust me, don't ask.

00:18:48.853 --> 00:18:49.895
Okay, dork.

00:18:49.979 --> 00:18:51.396
Listen, I'm going to
hit the urinal,

00:18:51.480 --> 00:18:52.856
maybe talk about
myself a little bit...

00:18:52.940 --> 00:18:55.567
Hang on. It's time
to sort things out.

00:18:55.735 --> 00:18:59.738
The truth is,
I love Fry. That Fry.

00:18:59.822 --> 00:19:02.407
And I love Leela.
Any Leela.

00:19:02.491 --> 00:19:04.367
We're robots,
and we're in love.

00:19:04.452 --> 00:19:06.286
Let's ditch
these meat jackets.

00:19:08.873 --> 00:19:10.248
Whoa! Cool!

00:19:12.126 --> 00:19:14.169
Hasta la vista, wiener.

00:19:15.212 --> 00:19:17.505
We'll be back, for our stuff.

00:19:20.968 --> 00:19:22.594
Why did their voices change?

00:19:22.678 --> 00:19:26.848
That's the one thing
we'll never truly understand.

00:19:27.183 --> 00:19:30.852
Uh, this is a bit awkward.
Or is it?

00:19:30.937 --> 00:19:34.564
I'm not sure. I lost track
around the second robot.

00:19:34.690 --> 00:19:38.735
Well, you know how I feel. I
waited for you for 1,000 years,

00:19:38.819 --> 00:19:40.445
I can wait a little longer.

00:19:40.529 --> 00:19:43.615
What a load a mush!
I've had it.

00:19:46.661 --> 00:19:48.787
He's gonna blow!

00:19:48.871 --> 00:19:51.706
Party, Bender!
Party for your life!

00:19:51.791 --> 00:19:53.583
No chance, high-pants!

00:19:53.668 --> 00:19:55.460
I'd rather die
and kill all of you

00:19:55.544 --> 00:19:58.171
than party for one
more millisecond!

00:20:01.092 --> 00:20:02.550
The Cyclops-eater!

00:20:17.316 --> 00:20:19.901
Hold on, man!
It ain't like that!

00:20:31.914 --> 00:20:33.915
Geez. What does it take
to kill me?

00:20:37.586 --> 00:20:40.964
Bender, you blew out
your excess capacity.

00:20:41.090 --> 00:20:42.924
You're cured!

00:20:43.801 --> 00:20:47.137
Sweet mercy! My hellish nightmare is over!

00:20:47.221 --> 00:20:49.180
I never have to
party again.

00:20:49.265 --> 00:20:50.765
Well, that's that then.

00:20:50.933 --> 00:20:52.517
We're back, everyone!

00:20:52.601 --> 00:20:54.602
Party!

00:20:56.188 --> 00:20:57.689
Yeah!

00:21:03.696 --> 00:21:05.280
Whee!
